WEBVTT

00:06.389 --> 00:08.433
Cut the crap!

00:09.142 --> 00:12.186
I bet you're a monster too!

00:12.270 --> 00:13.521
Kondo!

00:18.776 --> 00:20.445
Hey, what are you doing?

00:20.528 --> 00:24.949
The Ashiharas. You guys too, huh?
Don't come any closer!

02:02.338 --> 02:03.923
DEVILS' CREST

02:04.006 --> 02:08.177
EPISODE 4: SUSPICION

02:09.762 --> 02:11.556
What are you talking about, Gamo?

02:11.639 --> 02:13.933
What makes you think we're monsters?

02:14.016 --> 02:16.561
There's no other explanation!

02:16.644 --> 02:19.814
You killed that massive
creature, didn't you?

02:20.398 --> 02:23.693
Anyone who can pull that off
has got to be a monster.

02:23.776 --> 02:27.154
We have injured people
inside the barricade.

02:27.238 --> 02:28.948
There's no way I'm letting you in!

02:29.574 --> 02:33.077
I think we might have better luck
negotiating with Ohno.

02:33.160 --> 02:34.745
I know what you're up to.

02:34.829 --> 02:37.540
You're gonna transform like Watamaki

02:37.623 --> 02:39.584
and attack us, aren't you?

02:42.795 --> 02:47.550
Ohno, you saw Watamaki transform?

02:47.633 --> 02:49.093
Yeah, I saw it.

02:49.176 --> 02:51.429
Everyone here saw the whole thing.

02:51.929 --> 02:54.348
Watamaki came out of the Caliculus,

02:54.891 --> 02:56.809
turned into a faceless monster,

02:57.351 --> 02:59.353
and attacked Beroshi.

02:59.937 --> 03:01.105
Did you guys...

03:01.814 --> 03:03.858
Did you just leave Beroshi to die?

03:04.942 --> 03:08.613
Kondo, shut your mouth.
You don't know what happened.

03:09.196 --> 03:11.532
Tada and Aida are in the shop
with serious injuries

03:11.616 --> 03:14.243
because of what Watamaki did to them.

03:14.327 --> 03:17.997
<i>If Beroshi hadn't been there,
a lot more people would be dead.</i>

03:18.080 --> 03:20.458
<i>He put his life on the line
to keep us safe.</i>

03:20.958 --> 03:23.502
<i>There was no choice! We had to run!</i>

03:24.086 --> 03:27.423
Then we booked it to the lobby,

03:27.506 --> 03:31.010
only to find that huge monster
going on a rampage.

03:34.639 --> 03:36.349
<i>We carried Tada and Aida here</i>

03:36.432 --> 03:39.310
<i>and barely made it into this shop alive.</i>

03:39.894 --> 03:40.978
<i>Gamo's right.</i>

03:41.062 --> 03:44.482
<i>No normal human would stand a chance
against something that big.</i>

03:45.399 --> 03:50.529
So until you prove that you're
just as human as we are,

03:50.613 --> 03:52.657
we're not letting you past here.

03:53.699 --> 03:56.327
We've fought more than just
that pointy-headed freak.

03:57.620 --> 03:59.872
We also neutralized Watamaki

03:59.956 --> 04:01.832
when we found her in the Playroom.

04:02.416 --> 04:07.838
And we laid Miura to rest
inside a Caliculus.

04:10.466 --> 04:11.592
Beroshi...

04:12.218 --> 04:13.469
He's dead?

04:23.479 --> 04:24.438
Beroshi...

04:25.439 --> 04:27.233
Hey, he-twin.

04:27.316 --> 04:30.319
Forget about all that.
What did you mean "neutralized"?

04:33.030 --> 04:35.741
Forget about that?

04:36.450 --> 04:38.786
What did you do with Watamaki?

04:38.869 --> 04:41.372
Don't tell me you killed her!

04:41.455 --> 04:42.999
We didn't kill Watamaki.

04:43.499 --> 04:46.210
But it won't be easy...

04:47.586 --> 04:49.630
to explain what we did to her.

04:49.714 --> 04:52.133
Cut the crap. I knew it. You guys are--

04:52.216 --> 04:54.010
Gamo, shut up for a second!

05:00.099 --> 05:04.020
What was that? I'm the class rep.

05:04.103 --> 05:06.772
You're the one who needs to shut up!

05:15.865 --> 05:17.700
Some class rep you are.

05:17.783 --> 05:20.536
When Beroshi got attacked by Watamaki,

05:20.619 --> 05:22.955
you ran off without helping at all.

05:26.834 --> 05:29.628
And earlier, we were the ones
holding the barricade

05:29.712 --> 05:31.881
while you were cowering in the back.

05:36.343 --> 05:37.553
That was because...

05:39.055 --> 05:40.723
I'm the leader.

05:40.806 --> 05:43.976
If I go down, who's gonna
keep our class together?

05:44.060 --> 05:47.271
I'm the one who found
this safe zone for us!

05:50.566 --> 05:51.609
Okay, then.

05:52.443 --> 05:56.739
We'll deal with Kondo and the Ashiharas,
even if they might be monsters.

05:57.406 --> 06:00.534
The leader's supposed
to stay somewhere safe, right?

06:03.579 --> 06:07.875
If you wanna deal with them, be my guest.

06:08.459 --> 06:13.130
But don't let any of those three inside
no matter what.

06:18.511 --> 06:20.554
He called this a safe zone,

06:20.638 --> 06:23.390
but there's nothing safe about it.

06:23.974 --> 06:28.062
Hey, Yu, if another Conehead attacks,

06:28.145 --> 06:31.482
that barricade won't last ten seconds.

06:36.570 --> 06:37.404
Also...

06:38.322 --> 06:41.242
is that seriously the only thing
you had to wear?

06:41.325 --> 06:42.868
It's just a windbreaker.

06:42.952 --> 06:44.411
Oh, shut up.

06:44.995 --> 06:47.248
Ashihara, tell us what happened.

06:47.832 --> 06:49.708
What did you do with Watamaki?

06:49.792 --> 06:53.045
If you didn't kill her,
how'd you get her to stop attacking?

06:55.923 --> 06:57.049
I used magic.

07:17.653 --> 07:19.363
All right, let me try.

07:22.158 --> 07:23.033
Got it.

07:23.117 --> 07:24.201
What?

07:27.580 --> 07:29.498
So if we make our QRESTs like yours,

07:29.582 --> 07:31.709
we can pick up that hammer?

07:31.792 --> 07:32.835
Probably.

07:33.586 --> 07:34.879
How do we do it?

07:34.962 --> 07:36.630
Do we have to pay or something?

07:36.714 --> 07:38.340
There's no payment!

07:39.091 --> 07:40.176
I'll tell you how.

07:40.843 --> 07:43.971
But this is really important.

07:44.054 --> 07:45.848
I want to explain it to the whole class.

07:47.725 --> 07:51.020
Got it. I'll convince Gamo.

08:21.217 --> 08:23.761
<i>So, 17 people made it.</i>

08:24.803 --> 08:26.263
Where's everyone else?

08:26.347 --> 08:27.514
We don't know.

08:27.598 --> 08:31.769
Didn't everyone come down
from the second-floor Playroom together?

08:31.852 --> 08:34.647
No. The elevator wasn't working,

08:34.730 --> 08:36.815
and the stairs were packed like sardines.

08:36.899 --> 08:40.277
The ones in the back
went up to the third floor.

08:40.986 --> 08:42.696
<i>The girls were Fujikawa...</i>

08:43.572 --> 08:44.615
<i>...and Teragami.</i>

08:45.532 --> 08:47.284
<i>The boys were Niki,</i>

08:47.868 --> 08:49.745
<i>Haizaki, and the rest of that group.</i>

08:50.412 --> 08:51.956
The third floor...

08:53.666 --> 08:56.543
Even if there's another monster
on the third floor,

08:56.627 --> 09:00.881
I can't imagine Niki or Haizaki
going down that easily.

09:00.965 --> 09:03.050
Why'd you have to let them in?

09:03.133 --> 09:05.594
What are we going to do?
They're dangerous.

09:11.183 --> 09:14.728
So you said we could power up our QRESTs.

09:14.812 --> 09:16.105
How do we do it?

09:22.695 --> 09:25.572
Hey, don't drag this out. Tell us already.

09:25.656 --> 09:28.534
Yeah, we got other stuff to do.

09:51.348 --> 09:54.226
After we beat the pointy-headed monster,

09:54.310 --> 09:56.770
we checked things out at the entrance.

09:57.396 --> 10:00.149
We tried breaking the windows,
but nothing worked.

10:00.232 --> 10:03.652
Well, of course a shrimp
like you couldn't make a dent.

10:03.736 --> 10:05.237
It wasn't Yu.

10:05.321 --> 10:09.658
I slammed them with this hammer,
and they didn't even crack.

10:21.462 --> 10:23.088
I believe him.

10:24.006 --> 10:25.174
That idiot.

10:25.257 --> 10:29.345
It's probably not just the windows
and automatic doors that we can't break.

10:29.928 --> 10:32.264
All of the glass in the lobby
is pitch-black,

10:32.348 --> 10:34.224
so we can't see outside at all,

10:34.308 --> 10:36.310
and our QRESTs won't connect
to the network.

10:36.935 --> 10:40.939
In other words, unless we figure out
what's causing this,

10:41.023 --> 10:43.734
escaping Altea is impossible.

10:51.950 --> 10:56.080
So for now, we need to protect
the only shelter we have

10:56.163 --> 10:59.208
and give everyone here
the power to do that.

10:59.291 --> 11:00.709
That's our top priority.

11:01.210 --> 11:03.545
That's not your choice to make.

11:03.629 --> 11:06.423
I'm the class rep,
and I'm the one who found this place.

11:06.507 --> 11:09.885
So obviously, I'm the one
who decides what we do next!

11:11.095 --> 11:12.096
Ventus!

11:23.857 --> 11:24.858
Avis!

11:32.366 --> 11:33.534
Ignis!

11:48.882 --> 11:51.802
That was a spell, right?

11:52.636 --> 11:53.804
From Actual Magic.

11:53.887 --> 11:56.598
No way. It was some kind of trick.

11:57.891 --> 11:59.143
I don't think so.

12:01.061 --> 12:03.564
I felt wind just now.

12:04.523 --> 12:07.901
QRESTs don't support
touch feedback by themselves,

12:07.985 --> 12:11.071
so if we felt the air move,
that wasn't AR.

12:11.822 --> 12:13.615
That wasn't a trick.

12:13.699 --> 12:15.576
It was real magic.

12:15.659 --> 12:20.581
Then did you use magic
to defeat that monster?

12:20.664 --> 12:23.584
Not just that thing. Watamaki too.

12:23.667 --> 12:24.835
No.

12:24.918 --> 12:27.212
We did kill the monster.

12:27.296 --> 12:28.422
But Watamaki...

12:29.673 --> 12:31.842
We just restrained her
so she couldn't move.

12:32.342 --> 12:36.680
I'm going to look for a way
to turn Watamaki back.

12:37.181 --> 12:38.515
Turn her back?

12:38.599 --> 12:40.601
Is that really possible?

12:41.185 --> 12:42.769
I think there might be a way.

12:43.604 --> 12:45.105
There's gotta be.

12:47.191 --> 12:48.108
All right.

12:49.067 --> 12:51.820
Ashihara, I believe you.

12:51.904 --> 12:54.573
From now on, I'll follow your orders.

12:54.656 --> 12:56.366
Thanks, Ohno.

12:58.202 --> 13:02.623
Okay, then.
I'll teach you all how to use magic.

13:08.962 --> 13:11.256
<i>Should I really do this?</i>

13:18.222 --> 13:19.306
Yu?

13:29.066 --> 13:31.360
All right, let's get started.

13:42.996 --> 13:45.123
Now everyone's changed

13:45.207 --> 13:48.210
into the class they chose
during the Actual Magic playtest.

13:48.794 --> 13:49.711
Seriously?

13:49.795 --> 13:53.215
YOICHI OHNO - HARUKI HOKARI
TAKESHI MORO - TAKATO SERA

13:53.966 --> 13:57.636
Mages and priests
should be able to use their spells,

13:57.719 --> 13:59.972
warriors should be stronger,

14:00.055 --> 14:02.849
and thieves and hunters
should be able to move faster.

14:11.692 --> 14:12.901
Ashihara.

14:13.527 --> 14:15.988
Sorry for treating you
like a monster earlier.

14:16.071 --> 14:18.615
No, I don't blame you at all.

14:18.699 --> 14:19.950
It's killing me, though.

14:20.033 --> 14:21.994
If we'd known this sooner,

14:22.077 --> 14:25.038
maybe we could've saved Beroshi.

14:28.375 --> 14:31.003
Why are you laughing?

14:31.086 --> 14:33.547
What else am I gonna do? A loss is a loss.

14:33.630 --> 14:35.257
They were the better team.

14:35.340 --> 14:36.717
But...

14:36.800 --> 14:39.052
Don't worry, Yoi.

14:39.136 --> 14:42.514
Someday, I'll be the best guard
in the league

14:42.598 --> 14:44.558
and help you win some games.

14:44.641 --> 14:45.934
Beroshi.

14:47.144 --> 14:48.604
Listen here, benchwarmer!

14:48.687 --> 14:51.189
I'm the captain
and nobody talks down to me!

14:53.900 --> 14:55.193
All good, right?

15:00.157 --> 15:01.491
Beroshi!

15:02.159 --> 15:04.870
Go! Yoi!

15:05.370 --> 15:06.830
Ohno!

15:13.920 --> 15:16.089
Beroshi saved us all.

15:16.173 --> 15:18.383
We owe it to him to get out of here alive.

15:20.177 --> 15:21.345
Listen up for a second.

15:21.428 --> 15:25.432
If anyone here chose the priest class,
raise your hand.

15:26.933 --> 15:28.060
I did.

15:31.063 --> 15:32.481
Me too!

15:33.940 --> 15:35.567
Don't get cocky.

15:36.068 --> 15:37.944
Only three?

15:38.028 --> 15:40.572
Yeah. Fewer than I expected.

15:40.656 --> 15:42.199
Shimizu, Soga,

15:42.282 --> 15:45.577
and Moro should be able
to use healing magic.

15:45.661 --> 15:48.121
I want you to treat the injured.

15:49.039 --> 15:51.958
Right. We can heal them with magic.

15:56.296 --> 15:57.130
Moro.

15:58.298 --> 15:59.549
Yes?

16:01.218 --> 16:04.304
Please. Heal Tada and Aida.

16:04.388 --> 16:06.848
Beroshi gave his life to protect them.

16:08.141 --> 16:10.018
Ohno is asking Mo-yan a favor?

16:10.102 --> 16:11.770
I can't believe it.

16:13.647 --> 16:16.108
Okay. I'll give it a shot.

16:19.111 --> 16:20.737
Mo-yan's so cool!

16:21.613 --> 16:23.699
What was the spell again?

16:24.616 --> 16:26.576
Are you kidding me?

16:33.208 --> 16:34.209
Sacre!

16:40.173 --> 16:41.049
Premis!

16:43.635 --> 16:46.972
Fusione! Holy Healing!

16:58.859 --> 17:00.068
It doesn't hurt!

17:01.236 --> 17:02.696
Actually, it hurts a little.

17:02.779 --> 17:04.197
Wait, which is it?

17:05.782 --> 17:07.617
I'm fine, I'm fine.

17:08.577 --> 17:10.078
Magic is amazing!

17:10.704 --> 17:12.122
We did it!

17:12.205 --> 17:13.957
Next patient, please!

17:14.040 --> 17:16.793
You sound more like
a doctor than a priest.

17:21.673 --> 17:23.425
The pain is really gone!

17:23.967 --> 17:25.969
Okay, but calm down!

17:27.554 --> 17:29.306
You're incredible, Mo-yan!

17:29.389 --> 17:30.640
I can't believe it!

17:32.476 --> 17:35.437
From this day forth,
you may call me Grand Priest.

17:35.520 --> 17:36.980
Don't get cocky.

17:37.063 --> 17:39.232
That really was amazing.

17:39.316 --> 17:41.234
Give me some tips later, okay?

17:41.318 --> 17:42.986
Me too, please.

17:43.069 --> 17:44.863
Nice going, Moro!

17:45.447 --> 17:46.406
You guys...

17:46.490 --> 17:48.533
We're counting on you, Grand Priest!

17:49.659 --> 17:50.869
Yep!

17:50.952 --> 17:52.120
Yu!

17:55.332 --> 17:56.708
What are those?

18:10.472 --> 18:12.140
Yu, keep it right there!

18:24.194 --> 18:26.071
What? Did that work?

18:26.696 --> 18:28.323
It was splash damage.

18:29.908 --> 18:33.495
Everyone, these bugs go down easy
if you hit them with something hard...

18:40.919 --> 18:43.338
We'll have to handle this ourselves.

18:43.421 --> 18:45.507
Sawa, kick the worms off.

18:45.590 --> 18:47.592
Konken, crush them with the hammer.

18:47.676 --> 18:48.844
Got it!

18:48.927 --> 18:50.095
What about you?

18:50.595 --> 18:52.347
I'll do what I can with this.

18:58.562 --> 19:01.982
TABANUS HELLFLY LARVA

19:04.067 --> 19:05.068
We've got this!

19:14.828 --> 19:16.580
<i>Just seven or eight left.</i>

19:20.709 --> 19:23.378
Ashihara! Help Ruki!

19:23.461 --> 19:25.505
Hurry! Please!

19:37.392 --> 19:38.643
It's over.

19:38.727 --> 19:40.312
Ruki!

19:40.395 --> 19:41.563
It's probably poison.

19:41.646 --> 19:43.273
Is he going to die?

19:43.356 --> 19:45.775
No, it's most likely a paralytic poison.

19:45.859 --> 19:47.152
Just wait a little.

19:47.694 --> 19:50.280
Ashihara, Tomori's...

19:50.363 --> 19:53.658
Tomochi protected me,

19:53.742 --> 19:56.286
and all I could do was run away.

19:56.369 --> 19:58.747
It's not your fault, Tsuda.

19:58.830 --> 20:01.291
I couldn't do anything either.

20:01.917 --> 20:04.544
Soga, can you use an antidote spell?

20:04.628 --> 20:06.755
Yeah. I think so.

20:06.838 --> 20:09.591
Then try it on Shimizu.

20:09.674 --> 20:10.967
Okay.

20:12.135 --> 20:13.178
Sacre.

20:13.887 --> 20:14.971
Pluvia.

20:16.389 --> 20:17.599
Tersus.

20:18.892 --> 20:21.561
Holy Purification!

20:30.654 --> 20:32.364
Tomochi!

20:32.906 --> 20:34.574
Thank you, Soga.

20:34.658 --> 20:36.618
Thanks, Ashihara.

20:36.701 --> 20:37.827
Not at all.

20:37.911 --> 20:39.704
More importantly, once you can move,

20:39.788 --> 20:41.247
I need you and Soga to split up

20:41.331 --> 20:43.625
and cure everyone who's paralyzed.

20:43.708 --> 20:45.627
Okay. I'm fine now.

20:46.336 --> 20:47.587
Where's Moro?

20:47.671 --> 20:49.965
Moro's not here!

20:50.048 --> 20:52.342
Ashihara, over there.

21:08.024 --> 21:09.234
Mo-yan?

21:11.653 --> 21:13.238
What is that?

21:13.321 --> 21:15.115
A chrysalis?

21:16.658 --> 21:17.701
Konken, crush it!

21:22.372 --> 21:24.582
TABANUS HELLFLY

21:24.666 --> 21:28.128
Ten seconds later and it would've hatched.

21:28.211 --> 21:30.088
You okay, Moro?

21:30.171 --> 21:32.132
You're safe now.

21:32.215 --> 21:36.052
Shimizu or Soga can heal you right away.

21:36.136 --> 21:38.096
Can you get up, Mo-yan?

21:46.688 --> 21:47.856
What's wrong?

21:48.565 --> 21:49.774
He's dead!

23:27.997 --> 23:28.832
DEVIL

23:28.915 --> 23:30.083
<i>Protect them at all costs.</i>

23:30.166 --> 23:31.543
<i>Guess we didn't need this many.</i>

23:31.626 --> 23:34.754
<i>Who gave you the right to boss us around?</i>

23:34.838 --> 23:35.880
<i>Ratio is going up.</i>

23:35.964 --> 23:36.881
<i>I saw it.</i>

23:36.965 --> 23:39.175
<i>After that, he helped Sera and Hokari.</i>

23:39.259 --> 23:40.718
<i>Something's seriously wrong here!</i>

23:40.802 --> 23:42.929
<i>Nice to meet you, Yuumy.</i>
